WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.261
Hyperbolic, not residually finite.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.327
Hyperbolic groups people use are residually finite.

3
00:00:05.327 --> 00:00:07.754
Gromov asked whether all of them are.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.274
A triangle complex traps one element, which dies in every finite quotient.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.208
Claimed: so it is not linear either.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.132
Lean: main theorem.
